                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "59faa112-0c84-3a65-829d-608336ad3228",
                        "entry_id": "9064a036-1758-343e-90df-ef7dd1ea3e6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To use the slipform technique when creating a concrete structure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "47cfc8e0-4118-4767-8dfa-7bdbccfb5f64",
                                "sense_id": "59faa112-0c84-3a65-829d-608336ad3228",
                                "text": "Since most horizontal slipforming is against a fixed form support such as rock or earth, the operation is essentially a consolidating-screeding-finishing operation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0de1996-4699-47a1-b996-e9e63497fd92",
                                "sense_id": "59faa112-0c84-3a65-829d-608336ad3228",
                                "text": "However, with recent developments, it is possible to slipform continuous vertical flutings and varying cross sections."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d3fcc1a-a7f8-44da-88f4-5157c78b6dda",
                                "sense_id": "59faa112-0c84-3a65-829d-608336ad3228",
                                "text": "To facilitate and speed construction, Charlie Pankow chose to slipform not only the service and elevator core but also the stairwells -- a more complex operation than the slipforming of the American Cement Building."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5c97c12-5730-44b2-825d-8cdc7b6c0d87",
                                "sense_id": "59faa112-0c84-3a65-829d-608336ad3228",
                                "text": "New materials such as the by-product PFA helped attain the extra durability required and it is quite common today to slipform with concrete that has 30% replacement of cementicious material and large doses of admixtures."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
